      "writtenOn": "2019-06-17T16:30:31Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Do you have suggestions of port partners to test with for verification of these scenarios?  \n\nWe try to read all Rx messages that are ready during tcpc_alert(), so there won\u0027t necessarily be a 1:1 ratio between the number of messages received and the number of times we need to call tcpc_alert()",
      "parentUuid": "1c139df3_98395413",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 2679,
        "startChar": 0,
