      "writtenOn": "2019-06-17T18:05:41Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I don\u0027t believe we have a Zinger without updated FW, so I took an opposite approach of testing \"how high can this number be before we hit watchdog resets with a known bad port partner?\"  \n\nOn phaser, we can definitely set this higher, possibly as high as 480.  I need to work through the reasoning and additional considerations for a good general number (ex. how many PD ports?  What other tasks are we starving periodically?)",
      "parentUuid": "d3572227_d6788cde",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 2679,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 2680,
        "endChar": 35
      },
