      "writtenOn": "2019-06-18T15:39:06Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I believe this can be raised, which will limit the likelihood of interfering with a good port partner.  From testing on a phaser360 (2 PD ports, 3 sensors) with a single bad port partner:\n\n600 - watchdog resets occur\n400 - no watchdog resets occur, but sensor task reports reliably missing 4 data collections from lid accelerometer \n300 - no resets, lid sensor missing 2-3 collections, HDMI dongle in other port functions OK\n200 - no resets, lid sensor missing 0-1 collections, HDMI dongle in other port functions OK\n150 - no resets, lid sensor missing 0 collections, HDMI dongle in other port functions OK",
      "parentUuid": "5832d090_58678d2e",
